LegacyDroid
===========

LegacyDroid is a work-in-progress custom ROM built on LineageOS 21 (Android 14), targeting the x86_64 Android emulator (lineage_sdk_phone_x86_64).

Getting started
---------------

To get started with Android/LegacyDroid, you'll need to get familiar with [Source Control Tools](https://source.android.com/setup/develop).

To initialize your local repository using the LegacyDroid trees, use a command like this:
```
repo init -u https://github.com/LegacyDroid/android_manifest.git -b legacydroid-14 --git-lfs
```
Then to sync up:
```
repo sync
```

Building
--------

Source the build environment and select the device target:
```
source build/envsetup.sh
lunch lineage_sdk_phone_x86_64-ap2a-userdebug
```
Then build:
```
mka
```
